 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a single objectively “best” roofer, but **T&S Roofing Systems** looks like a strong first company to get a quote from: it serves Miami-Dade, reports a 4.8 rating across 1,271+ reviews, and lists Florida license **CCC1326032**. **Art’s Roofing & Construction** is another promising option, particularly if you want a local Coral Gables contractor; it advertises Miami-Dade HVHZ installations and lists license **CCC1333598**.\n\nBefore choosing, get at least three written bids and verify each contractor’s license and insurance. Ask for the exact roofing system and product approvals, confirmation that the proposal meets the applicable Miami-Dade High-Velocity Hurricane Zone requirements, who will pull the permit, and what workmanship and manufacturer warranties cover. Don’t rely on “hurricane-rated” as a standalone claim—the approved materials and installation details matter.",
